{"overview":"در دههٔ ۱۹۴۰، راهبه‌های صومعه‌ای دورافتاده در جزیرهٔ اسکاتلند برای طوفان قریب‌الوقوع آماده می‌شوند؛ اما وقتی نوزادی بر درشان می‌ماند، خواهر آگنس معتقد می‌شود که او شیطان است و می‌خواهد کودک را بکشد. پس از قفل شدن آگنس، سلسله‌ای تاریک از حوادث در حین طوفان رخ می‌دهد و هم‌راه با تردیدهای خواهران دربارهٔ ایمان و واقعیت، خواهر الیور باید توبه کند و از وقایع تاریک در سنت آگوستین نجات یابد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In 1940s, the nuns of a remote Scottish island convent ready for an impending storm, but when a baby is left on their doorstep, Sister Agnes becomes convinced he is the Devil and wants to kill the child. After Agnes is locked away a grim series of events ensue as the storm rages, and as her Sisters begin to question faith and reality, Sister Eleanor must try to repent and survive the dark events at St Augustine’s.","tagline_en":"Evil isn't raised, it's born.","runtime":100,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Nathan Shepka","Andy Crane"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB"],"cast":[{"name":"Maryam D'Abo","role":"Mother Superior","photo":"/AwcD84CIlQ0HaLRX3AqlmunYzgE.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Barber","role":"Amos","photo":"/9MkXuS9egXer8htsSLLXLXYgTdc.jpg"},{"name":"Amber Doig-Thorne","role":"Agnes","photo":"/8cEefOWzSpEl0kCQQtOPfysgG0S.jpg"},{"name":"Annabelle Lanyon","role":"Annalise","photo":"/9kqRLP6AcMuPa8CIcg6F4ypbUNR.jpg"},{"name":"Michaela Longden","role":"Eleanor","photo":"/4nzQJ91bK9pUsTNSpBLSJh29eQD.jpg"},{"name":"Elle O'Hara","role":"Valerie","photo":"/hf5p7xXH07HCNke2wCob1RDHcD0.jpg"},{"name":"Lisa Riesner","role":"Lucy","photo":"/l3FK8wKMHd025Hs4xQX4w5baRUj.jpg"},{"name":"Nathan Shepka","role":"Daniel","photo":"/szozn9qAMxLQFwPkRyexHWz7u5I.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Spriggs","role":"Satan (voice)","photo":"/hYhAWfaU3EIOKGywow4HJgE1GN9.jpg"},{"name":"David Rogerson","role":"German Soldier","photo":""},{"name":"May Milloy","role":"Peter","photo":""},{"name":"Scott Brand","role":"(voice)","photo":""}],"trailer":"aW6NNz_67_Y","watch"